{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve landed the dream job- mayor of a picturesque town rife with potential - congrats! The spec promised rolling hills &amp; friendly locals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What it DIDN\u2019T mention was the crumbling economy, vacant homes, and the logistics system that is just mostly you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a hard hat. Sprinting between disasters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/780036447f65c48fd6c0e05b87801e27.poster.avif?t=1752650512\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/780036447f65c48fd6c0e05b87801e27.webm?t=1752650512\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/780036447f65c48fd6c0e05b87801e27.mp4?t=1752650512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD AND EXPAND\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and manage everything in your town, from the ground up. Plot out zoning, place buildings, subways, entice visitors to move in full time, hire workers, stock shops, automate pipelines - generally EVERYTHING to keep the town running, and making money.\u00a0 <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/f8783fb91a463a20852485f520d5fe5a.poster.avif?t=1752650512\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/f8783fb91a463a20852485f520d5fe5a.webm?t=1752650512\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/f8783fb91a463a20852485f520d5fe5a.mp4?t=1752650512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AUTOMATE WITH INTENT\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign workers, optimise supply chains, set-up logistics networks and watch your systems flourish. Will you be able to trust in your automated systems to keep things moving? Or will you be the Mayor of Micromanagement?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/1c90250169ddba1e4567e2f5804a5a14.poster.avif?t=1752650512\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/1c90250169ddba1e4567e2f5804a5a14.webm?t=1752650512\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/1c90250169ddba1e4567e2f5804a5a14.mp4?t=1752650512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHAOTIC CO-OP CAPITALISM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo for ultimate control over your town, making every corner exactly to your liking. Or will you join forces with friends for total co-op chaos? As long as the profits continue rolling in, chaos can continue to reign. Just don\u2019t spend all that time running each other over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/da0898fa359583872e6280d8b579349b.poster.avif?t=1752650512\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/da0898fa359583872e6280d8b579349b.webm?t=1752650512\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/da0898fa359583872e6280d8b579349b.mp4?t=1752650512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MODULAR CUSTOMISATION\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tailor each business, industry zone and building configuration to suit your wants and needs. And of course, as mayor, you deserve a place to call home as much as your residents do. With some of the most immersive customisation options out there for your house, you can use the full 360\u00b0 and colour picker to make sure that every single corner of your space is exactly how you want it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/595abcee0049a0160ebc422656d7a919.poster.avif?t=1752650512\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/595abcee0049a0160ebc422656d7a919.webm?t=1752650512\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195120/extras/595abcee0049a0160ebc422656d7a919.mp4?t=1752650512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It's not a Bug, it's a Feature","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195120/b638a0d8d00c85f4d03d1265562e973bd536ec58.jpg"},{"name":"Don't leave me Hanging","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195120/c1b6601e1c82c1d7fa50bc55ade3ced6392d032e.jpg"},{"name":"Chicken Dance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195120/d79a809f01ba3bc0e5823cfb146fa09873d0a982.jpg"},{"name":"Rock On","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195120/73de51eddbdb02234f311066570bbab4e7d0258c.jpg"},{"name":"Driver's Ed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195120/0f6e34cdd781ed6c7c34236186e83f15a0125f10.jpg"},{"name":"Tier 1 Tech Tree","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2195120/e